      "text": "Post\n\nPost\n\nThe White Helmets@SyriaCivilDefAn individual was killed in a missile strike carried out by an unidentified drone targeting a motorcycle on the Sarmada–Bardaqli road in northern #Idlib, Tuesday, June 10. White Helmets teams inspected the site and reported no other casualties. Civilians at the scene recovered the bodies of the two victims and transported them to the hospital.\n#WhiteHelmets #Syria9:56 PM · Jun 10, 20258.6KViews12362"
